    "message": "Package DataStandardizer.ISO4217 has been replaced by package DataStandardizer.Money.  Future fixes and enhancements will be incorporated into DataStandardizer.Money only.  All users of DataStandardizer.ISO4217 are encouraged to migrate to DataStandardizer.Money at their earliest convenience.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
